{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0067-s001", "text": "I Finland har ett skolår 190 skoldagar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T021755823427+0000-1/hb-c08-u0067-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.458231292517007, "peak": 0.255706787109375, "generation_seconds": 10.137242513941601, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0067-s002", "text": "Skolåret, det vill säga läsåret, är indelat i två delar, en hösttermin och en vårtermin.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T021755823427+0000-1/hb-c08-u0067-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.260528564453125, "generation_seconds": 18.44416264188476, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0067-s003", "text": "Höstterminen börjar omkring mitten av augusti och slutar med en julfest före jul.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T021755823427+0000-1/hb-c08-u0067-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.285064697265625, "generation_seconds": 17.63278768491, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0067-s004", "text": "Efter det har eleverna jullov.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T021755823427+0000-1/hb-c08-u0067-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.9257142857142857, "peak": 0.26971435546875, "generation_seconds": 10.516787895001471, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0067-s005", "text": "Vårterminen börjar i början av januari och slutar i början av juni.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T021755823427+0000-1/hb-c08-u0067-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.229248046875, "generation_seconds": 16.206317348172888, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0067-s006", "text": "Vårterminen avslutas med skolavslutning, där eleverna och lärarna firar att läsåret är slut och sommaren börjar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T021755823427+0000-1/hb-c08-u0067-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.961360544217687, "peak": 0.3162841796875, "generation_seconds": 24.64142906293273, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0068-s001", "text": "Utöver jullovet och sommarlovet har eleverna under läsåret höstlov på hösten och vinterlov i februari–mars.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T021755823427+0000-1/hb-c08-u0068-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.334421768707482, "peak": 0.2608642578125, "generation_seconds": 29.91117604984902, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0068-s002", "text": "Om en finsk högtidsdag infaller på en vardag, till exempel påsk, valborg, Kristi himmelsfärdsdag eller självständighetsdagen, är den en ledig dag från skolan", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T021755823427+0000-1/hb-c08-u0068-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.79265306122449, "peak": 0.29541015625, "generation_seconds": 37.218106963904575, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
